    "q-186026": {
      "dom_id": "step-q186026",
      "name": "Question 7",
      "problem": "$225%$ of $32$ is equal to{{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "To solve this problem, we can use the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{part}=\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole}\n$$\n\nIn our case, the whole is $32,$ and the percentage is $225%.$ \n\n**Method 1**\n\nFirst, we convert the percentage to a decimal:\n\n$$\n225%=225÷100=2.25\n$$\n\nApplying our formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{part} & =\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole} \\\\  & =225%\\times 32 \\\\  & =2.25\\times 32 \\\\  & =72\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $225%$ of $32$ is $72.$\n\n**Method 2**\n\nFirst, we convert the percentage to a fraction:\n\n$$\n225%=\\frac{225}{100}=\\frac{225÷25}{100÷25}=\\frac{9}{4}\n$$\n\nApplying our formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{part} & =\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole} \\\\  & =225%\\times 32 \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{4}\\times 32 \\\\  & =9\\times \\frac{32}{4} \\\\  & =9\\times 8 \\\\  & =72\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $225%$ of $32$ is $72.$",
