    "q-186030": {
      "dom_id": "step-q186030",
      "name": "Question 10",
      "problem": "$240%$ of $50$ is equal to{{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "To solve this problem, we can use the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{part}=\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole}\n$$\n\nIn our case, the whole is $50,$ and the percentage is $240%.$ \n\n**Method 1**\n\nFirst, we convert the percentage to a decimal:\n\n$$\n240%=240÷100=2.4\n$$\n\nApplying our formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{part} & =\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole} \\\\  & =240%\\times 50 \\\\  & =2.4\\times 50 \\\\  & =120\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $240%$ of $50$ is $120.$\n\n**Method 2**\n\nFirst, we convert the percentage to a fraction:\n\n$$\n240%=\\frac{240}{100}=\\frac{240÷20}{100÷20}=\\frac{12}{5}\n$$\n\nApplying our formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{part} & =\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole} \\\\  & =240%\\times 50 \\\\  & =\\frac{12}{5}\\times 50 \\\\  & =12\\times \\frac{50}{5} \\\\  & =12\\times 10 \\\\  & =120\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $240%$ of $50$ is $120.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "field-1",
          "type": "blank",
          "dom_id": "freeResponseTextbox-1",
